# apps/reception — optional overrides
#
# Nothing is needed here in development: `pnpm dev` derives the API URL from the
# root `.env` of the monorepo (NEXA_API_PORT). Copy this to
# `apps/reception/.env.local` only to point this app at a backend other than the
# local one.

# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.qa.nexa.app
